# Environment variables for gotrip.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in as needed. M0 needs NONE of these —
# it runs on the scripted model + mock fixtures with zero network. Each variable
# below comes online in a later milestone.
#
# Loading: Node 20.6+ and tsx support `--env-file` natively (no dotenv dependency).
#   tsx --env-file=.env src/interface/cli.ts

# --- M1: real Claude tool-use client (AnthropicModelClient) ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Optional: OpenAI provider (OpenAIModelClient), if you add multi-provider ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- M4: real Google Places / Routes provider ---
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
